<title>USA: Papeles Nacionales SA Q1 loss 404 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Papeles Nacionales SA Q1 loss 404 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net loss		     404   profit	 1,415</p>
<p> Net sales		 16,483		   14,521</p>
<p>(All data above in millions of nominal pesos, according to Colombian GAAP)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company reported the following figures according to U.S. GAAP: net profits of $2.182 million compared with $3.619 for the same period a year ago, and net sales of $16.003 million vs $13.804 million.</p>
</text>
